msgid "Disable Map Fixes"
msgstr "禁用地圖修復"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:110
msgid "Performance"
msgstr "效能"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:113
msgid "Performance Mode"
msgstr "效能模式"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:114
msgid "Enables custom renderers to replace engine rendered world geometry and static props. Also controls engine culling patches. This will break mesh replacements in Remix when enabled."
msgstr "使用自定義算繪器代替引擎來繪製世界幾何體和靜態物體，並控制引擎的剔除補丁。啟用後會使 Remix 的網格替換失效。"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:118
msgid "Culling"
msgstr "不可見物體剔除"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:130
#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/customrender/cl_build_progress.lua:71
msgid "Static Props"
msgstr "靜態道具"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:137
msgid "Enables PVS culling for static props. May cause some props to cull incorrectly."
msgstr "對靜態物體啟用潛在可見集 (PVS) 剔除。部分物體可能被錯誤地剔除。"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:144
msgid "PVS Safety Distance"
msgstr "PVS 安全距離"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:153
msgid "Props within this distance always render, bypassing PVS. (0 = disabled)"
msgstr "此距離內的物體始終算繪，不受 PVS 限制。（0 = 禁用）"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:160
msgid "Distance Culling"
msgstr "距離剔除"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:169
msgid "Sphere-based culling for static props. With PVS on: applied after PVS as an extra filter. With PVS off: sole culling method. (0 = disabled)"
msgstr "按球形範圍剔除靜態物體。啟用 PVS 時，在 PVS 之後再進行此項篩選；禁用 PVS 時，僅使用此剔除方式。（0 = 禁用）"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:193
msgid "3D Sky"
msgstr "3D 天空盒"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:205
msgid "Enable 3D Sky"
msgstr "啟用 3D 天空盒"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:212
msgid "Renders 3D skybox map faces, displacements, and static props projected into world space. This does not include anything dynamic like particles, entities, etc. This is still WIP so there might be rendering issues on some maps."
msgstr "將 3D 天空盒中的地圖表面、置換地形和靜態物體投影到世界空間進行算繪。不包括粒子、實體等動態內容。此功能仍在開發中，部分地圖可能出現算繪問題。"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:228
msgid "Advanced: Engine Patches"
msgstr "高階：引擎補丁"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:248
msgid "Disable Engine Frustum Culling"
msgstr "禁用引擎視錐剔除"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:249
msgid "Force Brush Entity Backfaces"
msgstr "強制繪製筆刷實體背面"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:250
msgid "Force World Backfaces #1"
msgstr "強制繪製世界背面 #1"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:251
msgid "Force World Backfaces #2"
msgstr "強制繪製世界背面 #2"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:252
msgid "Disable BSP Culling"
msgstr "禁用 BSP 剔除"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:253
msgid "Disable Client Frustum Culling"
msgstr "禁用客戶端視錐剔除"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:254
msgid "Force NoVis (Disable Engine PVS)"
msgstr "強制 NoVis（禁用引擎 PVS）"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:275
msgid "You have enabled r_3dsky which may cause rendering issues with RTX Remix due how the engine culls the skybox. It's recommended to keep r_3dsky disabled for best results."
msgstr "您已啟用 r_3dsky。由於引擎剔除天空盒的方式，這可能導致 RTX Remix 出現算繪問題。建議保持 r_3dsky 關閉，以獲得較好的效果。"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:280
msgid "Don't show this warning again"
msgstr "不再顯示此警告"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:357
msgid "ToPBR"
msgstr "ToPBR"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:360
msgid "Enable ToPBR"
msgstr "啟用 ToPBR"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:361
msgid "Converts source material maps (normal, bump, ssbump, etc) to a pseudo-pbr format for RTX Remix."
msgstr "將 Source 材質的法線、凹凸、ssbump 等貼圖轉換為供 RTX Remix 使用的近似 PBR 格式。"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:362
msgid "Conversion is experimental and cannot reproduce every material exactly."
msgstr "此功能仍在開發中，轉換結果無法完全準確。"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:363
msgid "This will use a significant amount of VRAM, disk space, and may cause stability issues."
msgstr "會佔用大量視訊記憶體和磁碟空間，也可能導致穩定性問題。"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:365
msgid "Requires a map reload to enable."
msgstr "需要重新載入地圖才能啟用。"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:368
msgid "Experimental Metallic Detection"
msgstr "金屬度檢測（實驗性）"

#: packages/fixes/garrysmod/garrysmod/addons/remixbinary/lua/remixlua/cl/cl_rtx_settings.lua:369
